#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM.rst:2
msgid "maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM:1 of
msgid "Provide exponentially weighted (EW) calculations."
msgstr "提供指数加权（EW）计算。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM:3 of
msgid ""
"Returns an intermediate object whose aggregation methods (``.mean()``, "
"``.std()``, ``.var()``) compute exponentially weighted moving statistics."
msgstr ""
"返回一个中间对象，其聚合方法（``.mean()``、``.std()``、``.var()``）计算"
"指数加权移动统计量。"

#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/generated/maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM.rst
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM:6 of
msgid "The LiteFrame to compute on."
msgstr "要计算的 LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM:8 of
msgid ""
"Center of mass.  Resolved from ``com``/``span``/``halflife``/ ``alpha`` "
"via :func:`_resolve_com` at the public API boundary."
msgstr ""
"质心（center of mass）。通过 :func:`_resolve_com` 从 ``com``/``span``/``"
"halflife``/``alpha`` 在公共 API 边界解析。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM:11 of
msgid ""
"Minimum number of observations in the window required to produce a value "
"(otherwise null)."
msgstr "窗口中产生值所需的最小观测数（否则为 null）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM:14 of
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"If True, use the adjusted (weighted average) form.  If False, use the "
"recursive form (y_t = (1-α)·y_{t-1} + α·x_t)."
msgstr "如果为 True，使用调整（加权平均）形式。如果为 False，使用递归形式（y_t = (1-α)·y_{t-1} + α·x_t）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM:17 of
msgid ""
"If False, NaN positions are treated as absolute gaps (weights decay "
"through the gap).  If True, NaN positions are ignored (weights apply only"
" to observed values, relative positioning)."
msgstr ""
"如果为 False，NaN 位置被视为绝对间隙（权重在间隙中衰减）。如果为 True，"
"NaN 位置被忽略（权重仅应用于已观测的值，相对定位）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM:21 of
msgid ""
"If False, use unbiased variance (bias correction).  If True, use biased "
"variance.  Only applies to ``std``/``var``."
msgstr ""
"如果为 False，使用无偏方差（偏差校正）。如果为 True，使用有偏方差。仅适用"
"于 ``std``/``var``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM:24 of
msgid "Column(s) to aggregate. If None, all numeric columns are aggregated."
msgstr "要聚合的列。如果为 None，则聚合所有数值列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM:26 of
msgid "Set when created from a ``groupby.ewm()`` call."
msgstr "从 ``groupby.ewm()`` 调用创建时设置。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM:28 of
msgid ""
"Column(s) that define the order in which the window expands (equivalent "
"to ``ORDER BY`` inside a MaxCompute ``OVER()`` clause). The output row "
"order is unchanged; each row receives the EWM computed over the rows that"
" precede it in *order_by* order."
msgstr ""
"定义窗口展开顺序的列（等价于 MaxCompute ``OVER()`` 子句中的 ``ORDER BY``"
"）。输出行顺序不变；每行接收按 *order_by* 顺序在其之前的行计算得到的 EWM "
"值。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM:33 of
msgid ""
"Sort direction for each *order_by* column. A single bool is broadcast to "
"all columns."
msgstr "每个 *order_by* 列的排序方向。单个布尔值会广播到所有列。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM:36 of
msgid ""
"Offset the EWM leading edge by N rows. A positive value shifts the window"
" forward (look-ahead), a negative value backward (look-back). Matches the"
" MaxCompute ``shift`` MF-specific window parameter."
msgstr ""
"将 EWM 前沿偏移 N 行。正值将窗口向前移动（前瞻），负值向后移动（回溯）。"
"匹配 MaxCompute ``shift`` MF 特定窗口参数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM:41 of
msgid ""
"Flip the EWM so the recurrence runs from the last row backward. Matches "
"the MaxCompute ``reverse_range`` MF-specific window parameter. May be "
"combined with ``window_shift``."
msgstr ""
"翻转 EWM，使递归从最后一行向后运行。匹配 MaxCompute ``reverse_range`` MF "
"特定窗口参数。可与 ``window_shift`` 组合使用。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.window.ewm.LiteFrameEWM:45 of
msgid "If True, restore output to input frame's row order (grouped only)."
msgstr "如果为 True，恢复输出到输入帧的行顺序（仅分组模式）。"

